<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<GameData>
  <LocalizedText>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAP_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>组队PVP富饶大陆</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAP_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>以FFA富饶大陆的尺寸、海陆、资源和出生平衡为基底；支持2至12人任意人数，默认东西分队，两队按东西两半出生，大陆按一个个横向条带划分；可选按大厅排位软性安排队内前后排。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_MAP_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>FFA富饶大陆</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_MAP_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>适合2至12人混战的富饶大陆；保留原陆地生成宽度并额外增加2列贯通南北的接缝深海；普通地理大陆划分，最终山地约占陆地3.5%，并提供出生保底。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAP_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Team PVP Rich Mainland</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAP_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Uses the FFA Rich Mainland size, terrain, resource and start-balance baseline; supports every player count from 2 to 12, defaults to east-west team placement, splits the two teams across equal map halves, assigns horizontal continent bands, and optionally nudges inland teammates by lobby order.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_MAP_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>FFA Rich Mainland</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_MAP_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>A 2-12 player free-for-all map that preserves its land-generation width and adds two pole-to-pole deep-ocean columns at the east-west wrap seam; uses geographic continents, a final mountain share near 3.5%, and protected starts.</Text></Row>

