    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_2_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>推荐2人；60×34（含2列中央深海）。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_3_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>推荐3人；62×42（含2列中央深海）。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_4_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>推荐4人；64×48（含2列中央深海）。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_5_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>推荐5人；66×56（含2列中央深海）。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_6_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>推荐6人；68×62（含2列中央深海）。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_7_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>推荐7人；70×68（含2列中央深海）。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_8_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>推荐8人；72×74（含2列中央深海）。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_9_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>推荐9人；74×80（含2列中央深海）。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_10_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>推荐10人；76×84（含2列中央深海）。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_11_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>推荐11人；80×88（含2列中央深海）。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_12_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>推荐12人；82×92（含2列中央深海）。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_2_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Recommended for 2 players; 60×34 (includes two central-ocean columns).</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_3_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Recommended for 3 players; 62×42 (includes two central-ocean columns).</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_4_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Recommended for 4 players; 64×48 (includes two central-ocean columns).</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_5_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Recommended for 5 players; 66×56 (includes two central-ocean columns).</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_6_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Recommended for 6 players; 68×62 (includes two central-ocean columns).</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_7_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Recommended for 7 players; 70×68 (includes two central-ocean columns).</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_8_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Recommended for 8 players; 72×74 (includes two central-ocean columns).</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_9_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Recommended for 9 players; 74×80 (includes two central-ocean columns).</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_10_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Recommended for 10 players; 76×84 (includes two central-ocean columns).</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_11_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Recommended for 11 players; 80×88 (includes two central-ocean columns).</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAPSIZE_12_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Recommended for 12 players; 82×92 (includes two central-ocean columns).</Text></Row>
