    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_RICHNESS_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>富饶度</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_RICHNESS_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>综合影响地貌、资源、自然奇观、村庄和出生补偿，范围1至10。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_RICHNESS_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Richness</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_RICHNESS_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Controls terrain, resources, wonders, villages and start compensation; range 1-10.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>地图自带道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>沿主大陆海岸和河流预铺道路；默认为古典道路。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Prebuilt Routes</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Places routes along mainland coasts and rivers; defaults to Classical Roads.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_NONE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>无道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_ANCIENT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>远古道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_CLASSICAL" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>古典道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_INDUSTRIAL" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>工业道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_MODERN" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>现代道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_RAILROAD" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>铁路</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_NONE" Language="en_US"><Text>None</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_ANCIENT" Language="en_US"><Text>Ancient Roads</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_CLASSICAL" Language="en_US"><Text>Classical Roads</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_INDUSTRIAL" Language="en_US"><Text>Industrial Roads</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_MODERN" Language="en_US"><Text>Modern Roads</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_RAILROAD" Language="en_US"><Text>Railroads</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_COMPETITION_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>竞赛模式</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_COMPETITION_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>将富饶度固定为3并按间距分布地脉。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_COMPETITION_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Competition Mode</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_COMPETITION_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Fixes richness at 3 and spaces Ley Lines.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>战略资源</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>调整战略资源丰度。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_STANDARD" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>标准</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_STANDARD_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>标准战略资源丰度。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_MORE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>更多</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_MORE_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>提高战略资源丰度。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_MUCH_MORE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>极多</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_MUCH_MORE_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>大幅提高战略资源丰度。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Strategic Resources</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Adjusts strategic-resource abundance.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_STANDARD" Language="en_US"><Text>Standard</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_STANDARD_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Standard strategic-resource abundance.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_MORE" Language="en_US"><Text>More</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_MORE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Increases strategic resources.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_MUCH_MORE" Language="en_US"><Text>Much More</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_STRATEGIC_MUCH_MORE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Greatly increases strategic resources.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_SPAWN_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>分队出生方向</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_SPAWN_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>组队图默认东西；两队按地图中线分居面积相等的东西两半，分界不随两队人数变化；大陆始终保持横向条状划分。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_TEAM_SPAWN_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>FFA默认随机；大陆始终采用普通地理划分。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_RANDOM" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>随机</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_RANDOM_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>不强制分队方向。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_EW" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>东西</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_EW_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>两队优先在地图东西两侧出生。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_NS" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>南北</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_NS_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>两队优先在地图南北两侧出生。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_DEPTH_ORDER_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>队内前后排（软偏好）</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_DEPTH_ORDER_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>按大厅排位软性安排队内前后排：同队排位越靠上越靠后，越靠近本队外侧；优先保证纵向均匀。海岸文明不受此项影响，仍优先东西海岸。默认关闭。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_SPAWN_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Team Spawn Layout</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_SPAWN_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Team mode defaults east-west; the map midpoint gives the two teams equal east/west halves regardless of team size, while continents always remain horizontal bands.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_TEAM_SPAWN_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>FFA defaults to random; continents always use geographic stamping.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_RANDOM" Language="en_US"><Text>Random</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_RANDOM_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Does not force a team direction.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_EW" Language="en_US"><Text>East-West</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_EW_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Prioritizes opposite eastern and western starts.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_NS" Language="en_US"><Text>North-South</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_NS_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Prioritizes opposite northern and southern starts.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_DEPTH_ORDER_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Team Front/Back Order (Soft)</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_DEPTH_ORDER_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Softly orders inland teammates by lobby position: earlier rows prefer the rear, farther toward their outer edge; later rows prefer the front. Vertical uniformity remains higher priority. Coastal civilizations ignore this preference and still prioritize east/west shores. Disabled by default.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>城邦放置规则</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>选择城邦间距和后备规则。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_SINGLE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>单机</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_SINGLE_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>较宽松的单机间距。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_MULTI" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>联机</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_MULTI_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>联机平衡间距和安全后备点。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>City-State Placement</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Selects city-state spacing and fallbacks.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_SINGLE" Language="en_US"><Text>Single Player</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_SINGLE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Looser single-player spacing.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_MULTI" Language="en_US"><Text>Multiplayer</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_MULTI_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Multiplayer spacing and safe fallback plots.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_UNIFORM_DISTRIBUTION_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>文明分布均匀化（实验性）</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_UNIFORM_DISTRIBUTION_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>仅用于FFA富饶大陆。检查陆地出生的主要文明是否覆盖主大陆南北各区；若分布过度集中则重新抽取出生分布，最多20次，仍失败时采用安全后备分布。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_UNIFORM_DISTRIBUTION_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Uniform Civilization Distribution (Experimental)</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_UNIFORM_DISTRIBUTION_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>FFA Rich Mainland only. Checks whether land-start major civilizations cover the mainland's north-south zones and rerolls concentrated starting distributions up to 20 times, then uses a safe fallback if needed.</Text></Row>
  </LocalizedText>
</GameData>
